CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_FoundFossilInMtMoon::
    .string "I found this most remarkable fossil\n"
    .string "inside MT. MOON.\p"
    .string "I think it's of a rare, prehistoric\n"
    .string "POKéMON.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_ElectricTradeMoved::
    .string "Electric POKéMON are fascinating.\p"
    .string "Their evolution can change with\n"
    .string "the right kind of energy.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_MagmarTrade::
    .string "We developed the MAGMARIZER here\n"
    .string "to store concentrated heat.\p"
    .string "My MAGMAR is holding one.\n"
    .string "Trade it, and that stored heat\l"
    .string "helps it become MAGMORTAR!$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_MagmarResult::
    .string "The MAGMARIZER is our way of\n"
    .string "giving evolution a little spark.\p"
    .string "Please take good care of your\n"
    .string "MAGMORTAR!$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_MagmarResearch::
    .string "We designed the MAGMARIZER to\n"
    .string "hold heat until a trade releases it.\p"
    .string "Even a small invention can make\n"
    .string "a big difference to a POKéMON.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_ScytherTrade::
    .string "Our lab developed the METAL COAT,\n"
    .string "a special metallic coating.\p"
    .string "My SCYTHER is holding a sample.\n"
    .string "During a trade, it helps its shell\l"
    .string "harden into SCIZOR's armor!$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_ScytherResult::
    .string "SCIZOR's armor shows what our\n"
    .string "METAL COAT can help it become.\p"
    .string "I'd love to hear how it gets on\n"
    .string "during your travels!$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_ScytherResearch::
    .string "The METAL COAT was made here,\n"
    .string "but SCYTHER makes it its own.\p"
    .string "The same coating helps ONIX\n"
    .string "evolve in quite a different way.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_OnixTrade::
    .string "We developed the METAL COAT\n"
    .string "right here in this lab.\p"
    .string "My ONIX is holding a sample.\n"
    .string "Trading it lets the coating bond\l"
    .string "with its rocky body.\p"
    .string "That's how it becomes STEELIX!$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_OnixResult::
    .string "From rock to steel!\n"
    .string "Our METAL COAT helped that along.\p"
    .string "Look after STEELIX for me!$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_OnixResearch::
    .string "We make the METAL COAT here,\n"
    .string "but the POKéMON does the rest.\p"
    .string "ONIX becomes STEELIX.\n"
    .string "SCYTHER becomes SCIZOR.\p"
    .string "One invention, two very\n"
    .string "different evolutions!$"
